Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct: llama.cpp's Q4_K_M and the ball arm, each with no matrix, the matrix of the wikitext-2 training text and the matrix of no meaning, on two texts. 10,200 positions each.
An error of a gap is the root of the sum of the squares of the two standard errors.
From forecast.out: the ten most active dimensions hold 13.8 percent of what the attention reads. SmolLM2 has 61.8 and Qwen2.5 has 11.4.

